BT /F1 16 Tf 72 720 Td (Chapter Two. The Journal) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 690 Td (Before a figure reaches the ledger it is written in the journal, in the order in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 676 Td (which things happened. The journal is a diary; the ledger is an index. One answers) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (the question of what happened on a day, the other the question of what happened to an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 648 Td (account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 634 Td (Each journal entry names the accounts to be debited and credited, the amounts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 620 Td (and a short narration. The narration is the clerk\222s explanation, and a good one tells) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 606 Td (a stranger, years later, why the entry was made.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 592 Td (Posting is the work of copying the journal into the ledger. As each figure is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 578 Td (posted the clerk writes the ledger page beside it in the journal, so that a reader) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 564 Td (can travel in either direction between the two books.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 550 Td (Some businesses keep several journals: one for sales, one for purchases, one for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 536 Td (cash. Each is ruled for its own kind of entry, and only the totals are posted at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 522 Td (end of the month, which saves a great deal of copying.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 508 Td (The general journal remains for everything else: corrections, accruals, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 494 Td (closing entries at the end of the year. It is the book of the unusual, and an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 480 Td (experienced reader turns to it first.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 466 Td (An accrual records a cost that has been incurred but not yet paid, such as wages) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 452 Td (earned in the last days of a month. Without it the month would look cheaper than it) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 438 Td (was, and the next month dearer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 424 Td (A prepayment is the opposite: a cost paid before it is used, such as a year of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 410 Td (insurance bought in advance. The payment is spread over the months that benefit from) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 396 Td (it, so that each month bears its own share.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 382 Td (These adjustments are where judgement enters the books most openly. The clerk) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 368 Td (must decide how much has been earned, how much is owed, how long an asset will last.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 354 Td (The journal records the decision and the narration records the reason.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 302 50 Td (3) Tj ET
